WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.467
-We got more
bombshell revelations

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:04.100
from the committee investigating

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:06.133
Donald Trump's attempted coup
on January 6th.

00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:08.667
Today, the committee released
new evidence

00:00:08.667 --> 00:00:10.934
that Trump and one of the key
plotters in the coup,

00:00:10.934 --> 00:00:12.868
a lawyer named John Eastman,

00:00:12.868 --> 00:00:15.100
knew their plan
would violate the law

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.000
and that same lawyer also

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.701
had direct contact
with Ginni Thomas,

00:00:18.701 --> 00:00:21.234
the wife of Supreme Court
Justice Clarence Thomas,

00:00:21.234 --> 00:00:22.601
in the lead-up to January 6th.

00:00:22.601 --> 00:00:24.701
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:24.701 --> 00:00:28.968
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:28.968 --> 00:00:31.133
These hearings keep providing us

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:33.534
with more damning evidence
that Trump's attempted coup

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:36.567
wasn't just some spontaneous
outbreak of mob violence.

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:39.100
It was a detailed plan
orchestrated by figures,

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:41.334
including Trump himself,
who had criminal intent

00:00:41.334 --> 00:00:42.567
and who almost certainly

00:00:42.567 --> 00:00:44.467
knew what they were doing
was illegal.

00:00:44.467 --> 00:00:45.934
I know, on one level,
that's obvious,

00:00:45.934 --> 00:00:47.367
but it's still important
to establish.

00:00:47.367 --> 00:00:49.133
It's kind of like how you know

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:51.334
the mysterious British husband
in an HBO miniseries

00:00:51.334 --> 00:00:53.367
is the bad guy,
just from looking at him.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.367 --> 00:00:55.300
But you still need to like
watch Hugh Grant

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:57.534
push a dude out a window,
just to be sure.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.534 --> 00:00:59.100
And, even then,
Nicole Kidman's character

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:00.133
will probably still be like,

00:01:00.133 --> 00:01:01.367
"I just don't know what
to think.

00:01:01.367 --> 00:01:03.234
Fetch me my giant shawl.

00:01:03.234 --> 00:01:04.734
I need to go
for a midnight walk."

00:01:04.734 --> 00:01:05.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.834 --> 00:01:07.400
For example, the committee
played new video

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:08.734
from a deposition with Pence's

00:01:08.734 --> 00:01:10.367
former chief of staff
Marc Short,

00:01:10.367 --> 00:01:14.167
where Short said Pence has made
clear many times to Trump

00:01:14.167 --> 00:01:15.467
that he had no authority

00:01:15.467 --> 00:01:17.634
to unilaterally overturn
the election.

00:01:17.634 --> 00:01:19.567
-Was it your impression
that the vice president

00:01:19.567 --> 00:01:22.334
had directly conveyed
his position

00:01:22.334 --> 00:01:24.367
on these issues
to the president?

00:01:24.367 --> 00:01:27.501
Not just to the world,
through a Dear Colleague letter,

00:01:27.501 --> 00:01:29.567
but directly to President Trump?

00:01:29.567 --> 00:01:30.434
-Many times.

00:01:31.601 --> 00:01:34.167
-And had been consistent
in conveying his position

00:01:34.167 --> 00:01:36.033
to the president?
-Very consistent.

00:01:36.033 --> 00:01:38.467
-Although, no matter how
consistent you are with Trump,

00:01:38.467 --> 00:01:39.801
you know he's going
to keep pushing.

00:01:39.801 --> 00:01:42.501
The dude probably can't buy
a toothbrush at CVS

00:01:42.501 --> 00:01:44.667
without haggling.
"That'll be $2.99."

00:01:44.667 --> 00:01:46.701
[ As Trump ]
Alright, how about you
throw in five bucks

00:01:46.701 --> 00:01:48.534
and a lifetime supply
of toilet paper?

00:01:48.534 --> 00:01:49.567
[ Laughter ]
"No."

00:01:49.567 --> 00:01:50.701
[ As Trump ]
Alright, what if you just

00:01:50.701 --> 00:01:52.834
give me the toothbrush for free?
"No."

00:01:52.834 --> 00:01:54.133
[ Laughter ]
[ As Trump ] Alright.
How about this?

00:01:54.133 --> 00:01:56.334
I'll give you $2.99,
you give me the toothbrush,

00:01:56.334 --> 00:01:57.367
and we'll call it even.

00:01:57.367 --> 00:01:59.734
[ Laughter ]
"Alright, yeah, fine."

00:01:59.734 --> 00:02:02.434
[ As Trump ]
Another successful deal
by The Donald.

00:02:02.434 --> 00:02:03.767
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:03.767 --> 00:02:06.234
I'm going to turn this around
and sell it for $2.49,

00:02:06.234 --> 00:02:07.400
and then who's laughing?

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:09.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.033 --> 00:02:11.534
In fact, in a meeting in the
Oval Office on January 4th,

00:02:11.534 --> 00:02:12.701
the lawyer pushing the plan

00:02:12.701 --> 00:02:14.033
to have Pence
overturn the election,

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:15.734
a guy named John Eastman,

00:02:15.734 --> 00:02:19.000
admitted that his plan
would violate the law,

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.234
according to a deposition

00:02:20.234 --> 00:02:22.267
from a Pence lawyer named
Greg Jacob.

00:02:22.267 --> 00:02:23.667
We'll have more to say
on this meeting later,

00:02:23.667 --> 00:02:26.234
but here's what Jacob had
to say in that deposition

00:02:26.234 --> 00:02:28.534
about Eastman admitting,
in front of Trump,

00:02:28.534 --> 00:02:30.133
that his plan
would break the law.

00:02:30.133 --> 00:02:33.267
-When, exactly,
did President Trump know

00:02:33.267 --> 00:02:35.400
that it would be illegal
for Mike Pence

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:38.801
to refuse to count
electoral votes?

00:02:38.801 --> 00:02:41.133
Here is one sample of testimony,

00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:44.033
given by one of the witnesses
before us today,

00:02:44.033 --> 00:02:47.400
the vice president's
general counsel.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:51.501
-Did John Eastman ever admit,

00:02:51.501 --> 00:02:54.534
as far as you know,
in front of the president,

00:02:54.534 --> 00:02:57.167
that his proposal would violate
the Electoral Count Act?

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.200
-I believe he did on the 4th.

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:05.033
-So, that means Trump knew
it was illegal.

00:03:05.033 --> 00:03:07.634
Even his own pro-coup lawyer
admitted it was illegal,

00:03:07.634 --> 00:03:09.601
and yet, he still tried
to threaten and coerce Pence

00:03:09.601 --> 00:03:11.734
into doing it, to the point
where he basically sicced

00:03:11.734 --> 00:03:14.000
the violent mob on Pence
to get him to do it.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.968
I'm no lawyer, but how is
that not an indictable offense?

00:03:16.968 --> 00:03:18.701
I feel like even Nicole Kidman
would say,

00:03:18.701 --> 00:03:20.267
"Oh, yeah,
he's definitely guilty.

00:03:20.267 --> 00:03:21.334
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:23.200
I don't need the shawl
for this one."

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:24.501
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.501 --> 00:03:26.601
By the way, this comes on top
of all the evidence

00:03:26.601 --> 00:03:28.501
already provided
by the first two hearings,

00:03:28.501 --> 00:03:29.767
that Trump
and everyone around him

00:03:29.767 --> 00:03:32.334
knew his stolen election claims
were false

00:03:32.334 --> 00:03:34.167
and that they were
just fabricated pretext

00:03:34.167 --> 00:03:37.033
for a premeditated plan
to overturn the election.

00:03:37.033 --> 00:03:39.234
In fact, there was actually
supposed to be

00:03:39.234 --> 00:03:41.200
another hearing before today,

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:43.367
but that hearing, originally
scheduled for Wednesday,

00:03:43.367 --> 00:03:45.701
was postponed
for mysterious reasons.

00:03:45.701 --> 00:03:48.167
So far, members of the committee
have said the reasons

00:03:48.167 --> 00:03:50.167
for that postponement
have been technical --

00:03:50.167 --> 00:03:51.634
they need to give
their team more time

00:03:51.634 --> 00:03:52.934
to produce the materials,

00:03:52.934 --> 00:03:56.067
specifically, the video clips
needed for each hearing.

00:03:56.067 --> 00:03:59.067
-I understand there is a bit
of a change in the schedule,

00:03:59.067 --> 00:04:02.000
pertaining
to tomorrow's hearing.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:04.367
Do you know anything
about when it will be?

00:04:04.367 --> 00:04:05.667
What's going on?

00:04:05.667 --> 00:04:06.968
-I think we're just firming up.

00:04:06.968 --> 00:04:09.801
There's no big deal,
but I'll tell you.

00:04:09.801 --> 00:04:14.467
Putting together the video
and exhibits

00:04:14.467 --> 00:04:17.934
is an exhausting exercise
-Yeah.

00:04:17.934 --> 00:04:20.701
-for our very small,
you know, video staff,

00:04:20.701 --> 00:04:21.968
so, we're trying to --
You know,

00:04:21.968 --> 00:04:24.601
we were going to have one,
two, three in one week

00:04:24.601 --> 00:04:29.000
and it's just it's too much
to put it all together.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:31.167
-I get it. We also have
a small staff pulling

00:04:31.167 --> 00:04:32.501
and cutting together video clips

00:04:32.501 --> 00:04:34.133
three days a week
for our "Closer Looks."

00:04:34.133 --> 00:04:36.100
True story.
Here's a real picture

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:37.801
of our "Closer Look"
video researcher Emily

00:04:37.801 --> 00:04:39.133
from when she started
on this show.

00:04:39.133 --> 00:04:41.033
And here she is
after eight years

00:04:41.033 --> 00:04:42.634
of watching Fox News clips.

00:04:42.634 --> 00:04:44.701
[ Laughter ]
Oh, damn it!

00:04:44.701 --> 00:04:47.767
Guys, we got to deprogram
Emily again.

00:04:47.767 --> 00:04:50.067
[ Laughter ]
You know, if producing
these hearings

00:04:50.067 --> 00:04:51.200
is getting too hard
for you guys,

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:52.133
you know what you should do?

00:04:52.133 --> 00:04:53.200
You should just do them

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:54.300
from your attic at home.

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:56.334
[ Laughter ]
No audience, no crew,

00:04:56.334 --> 00:04:58.334
just Liz Cheney, an iPad camera,

00:04:58.334 --> 00:04:59.701
and an annoying painting
of a Sea Captain

00:04:59.701 --> 00:05:01.801
in the background.
There you go.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:01.801 --> 00:05:03.067
People don't know this
about Liz Cheney --

00:05:03.067 --> 00:05:05.701
she's actually a huge
Sea Captain fan.

00:05:05.701 --> 00:05:07.501
[ Laughter ]
This is true --
after we came back to the studio

00:05:07.501 --> 00:05:08.834
and stopped featuring him
on the show,

00:05:08.834 --> 00:05:10.601
I called her up and asked her
what she thought

00:05:10.601 --> 00:05:12.167
of the Sea Captain
and she told me --

00:05:12.167 --> 00:05:14.434
-"Please get him on tv."

00:05:14.434 --> 00:05:17.200
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:18.667
-Anyway, the reason they gave

00:05:18.667 --> 00:05:20.968
for postponing Wednesday's
hearing was logistical,

00:05:20.968 --> 00:05:22.467
though Congresswoman Zoe Lofgren

00:05:22.467 --> 00:05:24.934
did provide this tantalizing
hint that, perhaps,

00:05:24.934 --> 00:05:26.734
they had also learned
some new information

00:05:26.734 --> 00:05:28.901
that made them delay
that hearing until next week.

00:05:28.901 --> 00:05:30.968
-Explain to us why
tomorrow is postponed

00:05:30.968 --> 00:05:32.234
and how we should understand

00:05:32.234 --> 00:05:34.167
that affecting the rest
of the hearings.

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:38.834
-Well, I don't think it's going
to have much of any impact.

00:05:38.834 --> 00:05:41.901
We had a lot of hearings
compressed together

00:05:41.901 --> 00:05:45.133
and there were
logistical problems

00:05:45.133 --> 00:05:46.901
that are going to be avoided

00:05:46.901 --> 00:05:50.300
by kicking one of the hearings
over to next week.

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:52.400
-There's no reason
that I should think like,

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:53.667
"Oh, there's something going on.

00:05:53.667 --> 00:05:54.667
They learned a new thing,

00:05:54.667 --> 00:05:56.300
a witness backed out,"
et cetera?

00:05:57.100 --> 00:06:00.834
-Well, you know, we're
constantly learning new things,

00:06:00.834 --> 00:06:04.501
but this is
primarily logistical.

00:06:04.501 --> 00:06:05.400
-"Primarily."

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:07.067
[ Laughter ]

00:06:07.067 --> 00:06:08.367
-I'll just leave it at that.

00:06:08.367 --> 00:06:09.701
-Ooh!

00:06:09.701 --> 00:06:11.868
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:11.868 --> 00:06:14.634
That is quite the tease.

00:06:14.634 --> 00:06:16.601
I do like that members
of Congress

00:06:16.601 --> 00:06:18.367
who've spent their whole lives

00:06:18.367 --> 00:06:20.634
learning when to talk and when
to keep something secret

00:06:20.634 --> 00:06:22.634
are suddenly turning
into high school gossips,

00:06:22.634 --> 00:06:24.234
[ Laughter ]
now that they've got secret dirt

00:06:24.234 --> 00:06:25.367
the rest of us want to know.

00:06:25.367 --> 00:06:26.400
[ Changes accent ]
Did you hear about Rudy?

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:28.734
He was wasted
at the party last night.

00:06:28.734 --> 00:06:30.834
[ Campy voice ]
"Is that why he's not
in school today?"

00:06:30.834 --> 00:06:33.534
Mostly.
"Mostly"?!

00:06:33.534 --> 00:06:36.167
He also hooked up
with his cousin.

00:06:36.167 --> 00:06:38.701
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:38.701 --> 00:06:40.067
"Second, I hope."

00:06:40.067 --> 00:06:41.567
Yeah, second.

00:06:41.567 --> 00:06:42.868
He got wasted, first,

00:06:42.868 --> 00:06:44.868
and hooked up
with his cousin second.

00:06:44.868 --> 00:06:46.968
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:46.968 --> 00:06:48.767
That was definitely the order.

00:06:48.767 --> 00:06:52.100
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:52.100 --> 00:06:54.167
Say what you will
about this committee,

00:06:54.167 --> 00:06:56.100
but they do know how
to build suspense.

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:58.167
At the end of Monday's hearing,
for example,

00:06:58.167 --> 00:07:01.200
they played a preview clip
teasing what was to come.

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:02.567
It was a clip from a deposition

00:07:02.567 --> 00:07:05.267
with former White House lawyer
Eric Herschmann,

00:07:05.267 --> 00:07:07.634
describing a conversation
he had with Eastman.

00:07:07.634 --> 00:07:09.901
Here's a fuller clip that was
released later,

00:07:09.901 --> 00:07:12.067
of Herschmann describing
that conversation with Eastman

00:07:12.067 --> 00:07:14.434
after the attack on January 6th.

00:07:53.501 --> 00:07:54.267
I screamed...

00:08:01.334 --> 00:08:02.267
-[ Laughs ]

00:08:02.267 --> 00:08:03.667
-And I screamed --

00:08:15.801 --> 00:08:17.801
[ Laughter ]

00:08:17.801 --> 00:08:20.400
[ Laughter ]
Damn, that guy should
definitely audition

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:22.067
for the next season
of "Billions."

00:08:22.067 --> 00:08:23.567
[ Laughter ]

00:08:23.567 --> 00:08:26.067
The guy you'd be playing
is a hardass lawyer

00:08:26.067 --> 00:08:28.801
who has a baseball bat
with "Justice" written on it.

00:08:28.801 --> 00:08:29.734
[ As Herschmann ]
Hey!

00:08:29.734 --> 00:08:31.400
I [bleep] already got one
of those!

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:34.334
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:35.634 --> 00:08:37.267
Excuse me.
Effing got one of those.

00:08:37.267 --> 00:08:40.033
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:41.667 --> 00:08:43.067
Now, as we've explained,

00:08:43.067 --> 00:08:45.567
Eastman is obviously a key
figure in the coup attempt.

00:08:45.567 --> 00:08:48.467
For example, even though
Eastman apparently admitted

00:08:48.467 --> 00:08:49.667
that his plan
would break the law,

00:08:49.667 --> 00:08:51.567
Trump still tried to get Pence
to go through

00:08:51.567 --> 00:08:53.734
with Eastman's plan,
in a heated Oval Office meeting

00:08:53.734 --> 00:08:56.300
where Trump kept telling Pence
to listen to Eastman.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:58.667
-Stunning new details
on Donald Trump's efforts

00:08:58.667 --> 00:09:02.033
to overturn the 2020 election,
from the new book "Peril,"

00:09:02.033 --> 00:09:03.934
by Bob Woodward
and Robert Costa.

00:09:03.934 --> 00:09:07.968
The authors report on a two-page
memo drafted by John Eastman.

00:09:07.968 --> 00:09:09.868
John Eastman is
a conservative lawyer

00:09:09.868 --> 00:09:12.501
who was working
for Trump's legal team.

00:09:12.501 --> 00:09:14.801
It amounts to a blueprint
for a coup.

00:09:14.801 --> 00:09:17.067
NBC News has later
obtained the memo.

00:09:17.067 --> 00:09:20.534
It outlines how Pence was
to have disrupted

00:09:20.534 --> 00:09:22.868
the certification of the
Electoral College results

00:09:22.868 --> 00:09:24.834
and handed the election
to Trump.

00:09:24.834 --> 00:09:28.133
Trump tells Pence this
about Eastman...

00:09:34.167 --> 00:09:35.934
-He is not a respected
constitutional scholar.

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:37.968
No respected
constitutional scholar

00:09:37.968 --> 00:09:39.200
would ever be
caught dead working

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:41.167
for a famously corrupt idiot
like Donald Trump.

00:09:41.167 --> 00:09:43.501
Trump gets all his lawyers
from bus stop ads

00:09:43.501 --> 00:09:44.701
and TV commercials.

00:09:44.701 --> 00:09:46.000
[ As Giuliani ]
Hey, you want to do a coup?

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:47.267
Call Eastman &amp; Giuliani.

00:09:47.267 --> 00:09:48.434
[ Laughter ]
We don't have a phone number,

00:09:48.434 --> 00:09:50.267
but you can find us
at our office

00:09:50.267 --> 00:09:51.834
in the woods at Central Park.

00:09:51.834 --> 00:09:53.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:53.501 --> 00:09:55.601
Even though the cops
are always hassling us.

00:09:55.601 --> 00:09:58.834
[ Laughter ]

00:09:58.834 --> 00:10:01.634
We need a permit for a desk
in the park now? Alright.

00:10:01.634 --> 00:10:04.467
[ Laughter ]

00:10:04.467 --> 00:10:06.234
And, even in advance
of today's hearing,

00:10:06.234 --> 00:10:07.834
we kept getting more
and more details

00:10:07.834 --> 00:10:11.000
about the scope of this coup
attempt and who was involved.

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:13.200
For example, we found out
yesterday that Ginni Thomas,

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:15.400
the wife of Supreme Court
Justice Clarence Thomas,

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:17.300
had a direct contact
with Eastman

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:18.868
and that the
January 6th Committee

00:10:18.868 --> 00:10:20.234
has obtained those emails.

00:10:20.234 --> 00:10:22.167
-The Washington Post
is reporting tonight

00:10:22.167 --> 00:10:25.133
the January 6th Committee
"has obtained..."

00:10:33.601 --> 00:10:35.000
...who played a key role

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:38.033
in efforts to pressure
Vice President Mike Pence

00:10:38.033 --> 00:10:41.701
to block the certification
of Joe Biden's victory.

00:10:41.701 --> 00:10:44.200
-The spouse of a sitting
Supreme Court justice

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:45.968
was apparently
in direct communication

00:10:45.968 --> 00:10:47.801
with the key figure
in the planning of a coup.

00:10:47.801 --> 00:10:50.501
That seems like a pretty clear
conflict of interest.

00:10:50.501 --> 00:10:52.801
It's like if I found out
my parents were doing

00:10:52.801 --> 00:10:55.100
this year's Thanksgiving show
with James Corden.

00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:57.634
[ Laughter ]
Good luck, James!
Good luck, buddy.

00:10:57.634 --> 00:10:59.834
Hope you're fully stocked
on Grey Goose.

00:10:59.834 --> 00:11:02.100
[ Laughter ]

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:03.801
I'm not saying justices' spouses

00:11:03.801 --> 00:11:05.734
should always come into play
or be scrutinized,

00:11:05.734 --> 00:11:07.300
but in this case,
it seems pretty clear.

00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:09.334
I mean, Ginni Thomas
also reportedly pressured

00:11:09.334 --> 00:11:11.901
Arizona lawmakers to overturn
their state's results

00:11:11.901 --> 00:11:14.534
and texted Trump's
Chief of Staff Mark Meadows

00:11:14.534 --> 00:11:15.767
about a bunch of truly insane

00:11:15.767 --> 00:11:17.300
election fraud
conspiracy theories.

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:20.000
How can the Supreme Court
just ignore that?

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:21.634
In fact, the texts to Meadows,

00:11:21.634 --> 00:11:23.133
in particular,
are truly shocking.

00:11:23.133 --> 00:11:25.133
At one point, Thomas wrote
to Meadows...

00:11:32.934 --> 00:11:34.567
And in another,
she quoted a passage

00:11:34.567 --> 00:11:36.667
that had circulated
on right-wing websites...

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:55.567
And then again,
she texted Meadows,

00:11:55.567 --> 00:11:56.400
"Do not concede..."

00:11:59.467 --> 00:12:00.701
Whoa!
[ Laughter ]

00:12:00.701 --> 00:12:03.434
Those texts make Mike Lindell
sound like

00:12:03.434 --> 00:12:05.868
a levelheaded businessman.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:12:05.868 --> 00:12:09.033
[ As Lindell ]
That lady is crazier
than a [bleep]house rat,

00:12:09.033 --> 00:12:11.200
and I should know,
because you should hear

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:13.300
the things the rats whisper
to me

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:15.067
when I'm sleeping under

00:12:15.067 --> 00:12:16.934
da stairs!

00:12:16.934 --> 00:12:17.701
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:12:17.701 --> 00:12:19.801
Now, here's the thing.

00:12:19.801 --> 00:12:20.601
Here's the thing.

00:12:23.601 --> 00:12:26.234
You rats want jobs
inside a pillowcase?

00:12:26.234 --> 00:12:29.667
[ Laughter ]

00:12:29.667 --> 00:12:31.801
Don't think of it
as being stuffing!

00:12:31.801 --> 00:12:33.801
[ Laughter ]
Now, here's the thing.

00:12:33.801 --> 00:12:36.133
I know those texts
all sound insane to you,

00:12:36.133 --> 00:12:38.734
but it's important to remember
they really are

00:12:38.734 --> 00:12:41.234
[bleep] insane. I think
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:12:41.234 --> 00:12:43.467
my favorite part is
when she says

00:12:43.467 --> 00:12:46.934
the "Biden crime family &amp; ballot
fraud co-conspirators...

00:12:46.934 --> 00:12:50.267
will be living
in barges off GITMO."
[ Laughter ]

00:12:50.267 --> 00:12:52.334
Obviously,
all this stuff is bonkers,

00:12:52.334 --> 00:12:54.567
but I am curious
about one thing --

00:12:54.567 --> 00:12:57.434
why would they live
in a barge off GITMO?

00:12:57.434 --> 00:12:58.667
[ Laughter ]

00:12:58.667 --> 00:13:00.801
Like, why wouldn't they just be
sent to GITMO?

00:13:00.801 --> 00:13:02.734
Why would Trump, who, I guess,
I don't know,

00:13:02.734 --> 00:13:04.400
would be the supreme leader
in this scenario,

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:06.501
incur the extra cost

00:13:06.501 --> 00:13:09.100
[ Laughter ]
of running a barge offshore?

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:12.000
I mean, you got staff,
maintenance, you got weather.

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:15.300
Why wouldn't he just put them
in a cell inside GITMO

00:13:15.300 --> 00:13:17.334
and save himself all that?
And why am I

00:13:17.334 --> 00:13:18.834
pitching ideas on this?

00:13:18.834 --> 00:13:20.701
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:13:20.701 --> 00:13:22.767
This is how they get you,
isn't it?

00:13:22.767 --> 00:13:24.334
This is how they got Emily.

00:13:24.334 --> 00:13:27.000
[ Laughter ]
That's how they got Emily.

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:30.234
By the way, just last month,
Clarence Thomas gave a speech

00:13:30.234 --> 00:13:32.567
where he said that the judiciary
is threatened,

00:13:32.567 --> 00:13:33.767
if people are unwilling to...

00:13:35.801 --> 00:13:36.534
As well as saying...

00:13:41.567 --> 00:13:43.033
And that was him bitching
that someone leaked

00:13:43.033 --> 00:13:44.934
a draft opinion
that would overturn Roe v Wade.

00:13:44.934 --> 00:13:47.701
Meanwhile, his wife is burning
through her cellphone data plan,

00:13:47.701 --> 00:13:49.534
texting everyone
in their contacts list

00:13:49.534 --> 00:13:50.801
that it's time for an army
to gather

00:13:50.801 --> 00:13:52.434
because an election
didn't break her way.

00:13:52.434 --> 00:13:54.801
"We need to live with outcomes
we don't agree with.

00:13:54.801 --> 00:13:57.734
Now, let's get those barges
ready for the Bidens!"

00:13:57.734 --> 00:13:59.200
[ Laughter and applause ]
[ As Lindell ] Whoa!

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:01.200
Cool down, Ginni.

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:04.133
[ Laughter and applause ]
Once again, these hearings

00:14:04.133 --> 00:14:05.834
have provided
more damning evidence

00:14:05.834 --> 00:14:07.968
that Trump and his cronies
knew what they were doing

00:14:07.968 --> 00:14:09.934
would violate the law,
and tried to do it anyway.

00:14:09.934 --> 00:14:12.367
It was a detailed,
orchestrated plan for a coup

00:14:12.367 --> 00:14:13.334
and they almost got
away with it.

00:14:13.334 --> 00:14:14.667
Again, I'm not a lawyer,

00:14:14.667 --> 00:14:16.334
but if you genuinely think

00:14:16.334 --> 00:14:18.934
Trump didn't commit a crime,
all I can say is...

00:14:18.934 --> 00:14:20.868
